%%% note
由来: mulet test/mulet/io_test.clj:209 (writeXml-writeNilOnNull-test)
testing: writeNilOnNull true — null values output with xsi:nil marker
元の形: io/writeXml の直接呼び出しを DW に書き換え
mulet: 成功
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/json
---
write({"root": {"name": "Alice", "age": null}}, "application/xml", {"writeNilOnNull": true})
%%% output application/json
"<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>\n<root>\n  <name>Alice</name>\n  <age xmlns:xsi=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance\" xsi:nil=\"true\"/>\n</root>"
